    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33537" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palpus</span></b> , i, m.
		(nom. not in use) [1. palpo], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the soft palm of the hand</i> (Plautin.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">timidam palpo percutit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Am. 1, 3, 28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palpo percutis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Merc. 1, 2, 42</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mi obtrudere non potes palpum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Ps. 4, 1, 35</span></i>
			.</div>
